    "description": "NCEI Accession 0144623 includes discrete sample and profile data collected from BARUNA JAYA I in the Bali Sea, Banda Sea, Celebes Sea, Ceram Sea or Seram Sea, Flores Sea, Java Sea, Makassar Strait, Molucca Sea and Timor Sea from 1993-08-08 to 1993-09-09. These data include CHLOROFLUOROCARBON-11 (CFC-11), CHLOROFLUOROCARBON-12 (CFC-12), DISSOLVED OXYGEN, HYDROSTATIC PRESSURE, Potential temperature (theta), SALINITY and WATER TEMPERATURE. The instruments used to collect these data include CTD and bottle.\n\nThese data were collected by Arnold Gordon of Columbia University; Lamont-Doherty Earth Observatory as part of the GLODAPv2_42BJ19930808 data set. CDIAC associated the following cruise ID(s) with this data set: Arlindo '93",
